00:25:20.599 --> 00:26:09.619
You chose to give yourself superpowers.

00:26:09.619 --> 00:26:12.619
There's a piece of beauty a rock from small villain.

00:26:12.619 --> 00:26:14.619
No, it's, it's all right.

00:26:14.619 --> 00:26:21.769
I'll hurt you.

00:26:21.769 --> 00:26:23.769
It's not what you call cryptidone.

00:26:23.769 --> 00:26:47.940
He's dead. I'll get the treatment ready.

00:26:47.940 --> 00:27:39.680
We're infected by a being that you released from the Phantom Zone.

00:27:39.680 --> 00:27:41.680
The Phantom Zone doesn't exist.

00:27:41.680 --> 00:27:47.779
We're a human.

00:27:47.779 --> 00:27:50.779
That spirit would have taken you over with ease,

00:27:50.779 --> 00:27:53.779
like Zahd did with Lex Luthor.

00:27:53.779 --> 00:28:01.339
But you're a lot stronger than that.

00:28:01.339 --> 00:28:02.339
You're patient and men.

00:28:02.339 --> 00:28:04.339
to hospital be just as crazy as I.

00:28:04.339 --> 00:28:08.339
If you give in to Hudson and undergo this treatment,

00:28:08.339 --> 00:28:12.339
the entity will gain control of your body with all its powers

00:28:12.339 --> 00:28:15.339
and unite the other fugitives from the Phantom Zone.

00:28:15.339 --> 00:28:18.339
Together they'll enslave all of mankind.

00:28:18.339 --> 00:28:21.339
This is all in my head, then how are you here?

00:28:21.339 --> 00:28:24.339
I'm in your mind as well, trying to help.

00:28:24.339 --> 00:28:28.339
But there's only one way to purge this parasite and regain your consciousness.

00:28:28.339 --> 00:28:33.740
You have to kill Hudson.

00:28:33.740 --> 00:28:34.740
Kill Hudson.

00:28:34.740 --> 00:28:35.740
Kill Hudson.

00:28:35.740 --> 00:28:39.680
I can't kill a man.

00:28:39.680 --> 00:28:40.680
He's not a man.

00:28:40.680 --> 00:28:42.680
Hudson's a phantom.

00:28:42.680 --> 00:28:46.680
You told me not to trust anyone. Why should I trust you?

00:28:46.680 --> 00:28:49.680
You know who you are, Kellel.

00:28:49.680 --> 00:28:50.680
Trust yourself.

00:28:50.680 --> 00:28:59.380
Like it isn't our little visitor from Mars.

00:28:59.380 --> 00:29:03.380
Look within. Believe in yourself.

00:29:03.380 --> 00:29:06.380
The future of mankind depends on it.

00:29:06.380 --> 00:29:12.759
What's the matter there, freak, huh?

00:29:12.759 --> 00:29:14.759
Scared of a little fire?

00:29:14.759 --> 00:29:16.759
Is it Mars the red hot planet?

00:29:16.759 --> 00:29:17.759
Welcome home.

00:29:17.759 --> 00:29:21.289
Come home.

00:29:21.289 --> 00:29:22.289
Get him out of here.

00:29:22.289 --> 00:29:28.410
It's time, Mr. Kent.

00:29:28.410 --> 00:29:44.420
To go through this alone.

00:29:44.420 --> 00:29:46.420
Dr. Hudson said I could come.

00:29:46.420 --> 00:29:50.119
You're so close, Clark.

00:29:50.119 --> 00:29:54.119
You're gonna get better and we can finally be together,

00:29:54.119 --> 00:29:57.750
like we were always meant to be.

00:29:57.750 --> 00:29:58.750
I want you to be real.

00:29:58.750 --> 00:30:17.059
Let's say that I am, and that your world really does exist.

00:30:17.059 --> 00:30:38.619
An alien from another planet who's responsible for so many...

00:30:38.619 --> 00:30:40.619
I don't know what to believe anymore.

00:30:40.619 --> 00:30:43.619
Wouldn't you just want to take this dream and be with me?

00:30:43.619 --> 00:30:44.619
Be with me.

00:30:44.619 --> 00:30:46.619
Of course, I want to be with you.

00:30:46.619 --> 00:30:50.740
More than you could ever imagine.

00:30:50.740 --> 00:30:56.190
Then, stop fighting.

00:30:56.190 --> 00:30:59.190
Live like this for so long carried this burden of being a hero.

00:30:59.190 --> 00:31:06.980
It's never been normal.

00:31:06.980 --> 00:31:38.740
Your destiny isn't to save the world.

00:31:38.740 --> 00:31:40.740
There's no need to be afraid, Clark.

00:31:40.740 --> 00:31:41.740
The procedure is quite painless.

00:31:41.740 --> 00:32:02.109
We'll be over in the blink of an eye.

00:32:02.109 --> 00:34:32.619
You're sure I was only out for a second.

00:34:32.619 --> 00:34:37.099
I was walking from my car when I heard you fall

00:34:37.099 --> 00:34:39.099
and by the time I got to the barn you were on your feet.

00:34:39.099 --> 00:34:43.429
It felt like a lifetime.

00:34:43.429 --> 00:34:44.429
I gotta give the Phantom props.

00:34:44.429 --> 00:34:48.429
props, dangling the Lana carrot is a pretty tempting offer.

00:34:48.429 --> 00:34:52.429
But he clearly has never come across the steel will of Clerk Kent.

00:34:52.429 --> 00:34:59.840
Chloe, you don't understand.

00:34:59.840 --> 00:35:02.840
I almost gave up everything and everyone that I care about.

00:35:02.840 --> 00:35:10.659
Wait a second.

00:35:10.659 --> 00:35:14.659
Based on the pending nuptials, I thought Lana was past tense.

00:35:14.659 --> 00:35:25.179
The truth is, I still love her.

00:35:25.179 --> 00:35:34.309
As Cryptonite's not your only weakness.

00:35:34.309 --> 00:35:42.019
So who was I in your alternate universe?

00:35:42.019 --> 00:35:45.019
Editor and Chief of the Daily Planet?

00:35:45.019 --> 00:35:53.820
Pulitzer Prize winner, maybe.

00:35:53.820 --> 00:35:54.820
Something like that.

00:35:54.820 --> 00:36:02.780
The important part is, you are the one person who believed in me.

00:36:02.780 --> 00:36:13.710
I don't know what I'd do without you, Chloe.

00:36:13.710 --> 00:36:16.710
Oh, is this when I'm supposed to cue the Barry Mantelow music?

00:36:16.710 --> 00:36:22.360
No, seriously.

00:36:22.360 --> 00:36:37.860
You mean a lot more to me than you know.

00:36:49.860 --> 00:36:56.860
You look to make sense and I can't leave.

00:36:56.860 --> 00:37:00.860
Mine won't focus and I can't see straight.

00:37:00.860 --> 00:37:02.860
I don't care if...

00:37:02.860 --> 00:37:04.860
You look like you've got something on your mind.

00:37:04.860 --> 00:37:05.860
Yeah.

00:37:05.860 --> 00:37:07.860
It's that obvious, huh?

00:37:07.860 --> 00:37:11.860
You don't hide your feelings as well as you think.

00:37:11.860 --> 00:37:16.719
How you doing? I mean...

00:37:16.719 --> 00:37:17.719
Fine.

00:37:17.719 --> 00:37:20.719
Yeah, everything's fine.

00:37:21.719 --> 00:37:25.119
Good.

00:37:25.119 --> 00:37:26.119
Tell you're gonna tell me?

00:37:26.119 --> 00:37:30.809
What's that look in your eye?

00:37:30.809 --> 00:37:37.960
I had a dream about you last night.

00:37:37.960 --> 00:37:42.489
I hope that it wasn't a nightmare.

00:37:42.489 --> 00:37:50.730
No. You were 10 years old and I gave you a plastic ring from a gumball machine at Clint's Market.

00:37:50.730 --> 00:37:57.699
Sweet. What was the occasion?

00:37:57.699 --> 00:38:05.070
It was an engagement ring.

00:38:05.070 --> 00:38:09.280
What happened next?

00:38:09.280 --> 00:38:12.199
I woke up.

00:38:20.199 --> 00:38:21.199
Lana.

00:38:21.199 --> 00:38:27.199
I should have guessed your delay wasn't the herbal tea.

00:38:27.199 --> 00:38:35.090
Clark?

00:38:35.090 --> 00:38:39.300
It's good to see you out and about, Likes.

00:38:39.300 --> 00:38:44.539
You know, you actually sounded convincing when you said that.

00:38:44.539 --> 00:38:47.539
I appreciate the civility.

00:38:47.539 --> 00:38:51.929
You ready to go?

00:38:51.929 --> 00:38:55.239
I want to keep the wedding plan of waiting.

00:38:55.239 --> 00:38:57.239
Yeah, we were just saying goodbye.

